Package: jwcalendarR
Type: Package
Title: Structural Calendar Analysis and Finite Date-Rule Compilation
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Karen", "Cohen",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "jwcalendarcom@gmail.com")
Description: Implements validated Gregorian civil-date operations and
    proleptic Julian conversion alongside ordinal and ISO week coordinates.
    Calendar grids support structural comparison and versioned signatures;
    declarative date rules can be compiled by enumerating a finite date
    domain. Reproducible validation utilities provide boundary diagnostics,
    date-pipeline audits, and test vectors. Civil dates are represented
    without conversion through timestamps. Gregorian and Julian calendar
    conversion methods follow Reingold and Dershowitz (2018)
    <doi:10.1017/9781107415058>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://jwcalendar.com/, https://github.com/karencohenjw/jwcalendarR
